6. Roles in a Project
Frontend Developer

Responsible for the user interface and user experience.

Main work:

Creates webpages
Designs buttons, menus, forms
Makes websites responsive
Uses HTML, CSS and JavaScript
Backend Developer

Responsible for server-side logic and APIs.

Main work:

Creates APIs
Handles user authentication
Processes requests
Connects application with database
Database Administrator (DBA)

Responsible for managing and maintaining databases.

Main work:

Creates and manages databases
Maintains data security
Performs backups
Controls database access
Improves database performance